<title>UK: Man Utd gains after championship victory.</title>
<headline>Man Utd gains after championship victory.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Manchester United Plc rose in pre-market trade on Wednesday after the club maintained its hold on the English soccer league championship.</p>
<p>Manchester shares were up 6p at 667 by 0727 GMT in thin trade of 7,001 shares.  </p>
<p>A defeat last night for challengers Liverpool and a draw by Newcastle, down 5p at 118-1/2, gave Manchester its fourth league championship of the past five years and confirmed its place in lucrative European competition next season.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
